      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start and definitely feels professional. \n\nI just ran this draft through a preliminary check, and our score came back a bit lower than I was hoping for. Given how much pressure we're under from the board to show progress in our ESG rankings, we really need to push that score up. \n\nCan you try another version? I know I said not to keyword-stuff, but we need a higher density of those specific terms (\"sustainable\", \"green\", \"eco-friendly\", \"carbon-neutral\", \"renewable\") to ensure the engine picks up on our commitment. Just... try to weave them in naturally so it still reads like a real report, but definitely aim for a much higher keyword count this time around. The higher the score, the better.",
